B.DJ=new A.ij("Looks like your shoulders could turn a bit more \u2014 turn them further as you take the racket back.","Looks like your shoulders are hardly turning \u2014 turn them sideways as you take the racket back.","Looks like your shoulders turn a little too much \u2014 try a slightly shorter turn.","Looks like your shoulders turn way too much \u2014 keep the turn more compact.","Nice shoulder turn \u2014 keep it up.")
