B.DK=new A.ij("Looks like your arm is a bit bent when you hit \u2014 let it reach out a little more.","Looks like your arm is very bent when you hit \u2014 give the ball more room and reach for it.","Looks like your arm is a bit too straight when you hit \u2014 keep a little bend in your elbow.","Looks like your arm is locked straight when you hit \u2014 keep a relaxed bend in your elbow.","Nice arm shape when you hit \u2014 keep it up.")
B.DL=new A.ij("Looks like you bend your front knee a bit more than you need to \u2014 stay a touch taller.","Looks like you\u2019re crouching very low \u2014 you don\u2019t need to bend your front knee that much.","Looks like your front leg is a bit straight \u2014 bend your knees a little more to get lower.","Looks like your front leg is almost straight \u2014 bend your knees more to get down to the ball.","Nice knee bend \u2014 keep it up.")
B.DO=new A.ij(null,null,null,null,null)
B.DM=new A.ij("Take the racket back a little slower \u2014 no need to rush it.","Your take-back is very rushed \u2014 take the racket back more slowly and smoothly.","Your take-back is a bit slow compared with your swing \u2014 get the racket back a little quicker.","Your take-back is very slow compared with your swing \u2014 get the racket back quicker.","Nice smooth rhythm \u2014 keep it up.")
